      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m in favor of including what we use. If these .c files are using names defined in `devicetree.h`, then they should directly include `devicetree.h`. But if they are also using names defined in, e.g. `devicetree/gpio.h`, then I think they should also directly include `devicetree/gpio.h`.\n\nTo my mind, the only exception would be if `devicetree.h` somehow publicly promises to transitively include `devicetree/*.h`, and including `devicetree.h` is the way you\u0027re supposed to do it upstream.",
